---
import BaseLayout from "../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy for ChatGPT Session Saver - getmanov.com";
const description =
  "Privacy Policy for the ChatGPT Session Saver browser extension.";
const canonical = "/tools/session-saver/privacy-policy/";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <section class="policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">ChatGPT Session Saver</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="effective-date">Effective date: September 28, 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how the ChatGPT Session Saver browser
      extension handles information when you use it to save ChatGPT conversation
      sessions from your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>
    <p>
      ChatGPT Session Saver is designed to help you save your ChatGPT
      conversations locally. To provide this functionality, the extension may
      access the visible content of the active ChatGPT page only when you choose
      to save a session.
    </p>
    <p>
      The extension does not send your conversation content to external servers,
      advertising networks, or analytics providers.
    </p>

    <h2>Optional Product Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      ChatGPT Session Saver may collect limited usage and diagnostic analytics
      only after you explicitly enable analytics in the extension. If you do
      not enable analytics, the extension does not send analytics requests.
    </p>
    <p>
      When enabled, the extension uses a randomly generated persistent
      pseudonymous installation identifier and may send product events such as
      saves, job completion status, exports, recovery actions, and review
      interactions. These events help us understand how the extension works
      and where it can be improved.
    </p>
    <p>
      Analytics events do not include conversation content, questions, answers,
      conversation URLs or IDs, search queries, DOM content, raw error messages,
      or stack traces. The extension sends opted-in analytics events to
      getmanov.com infrastructure hosted on Netlify, where approved events may
      be processed using Google Analytics 4.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Storage</h2>
    <p>
      Saved sessions are stored locally on your device using browser storage.
      getmanov.com does not receive or store your saved ChatGPT sessions. The
      telemetry endpoint validates and forwards opted-in analytics events; it
      does not write event request bodies to an application database.
    </p>

    <h2>Permissions</h2>
    <p>The extension may request browser permissions required for its core functionality:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>activeTab:</strong> to access the active ChatGPT tab when you save a session.</li>
      <li><strong>scripting:</strong> to read page content needed for saving the current session.</li>
      <li><strong>storage:</strong> to store saved sessions locally in your browser.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>User Control</h2>
    <p>
      You remain in control of your saved data and analytics preference. You
      can view or delete saved sessions from the extension interface or by
      clearing the extension's browser storage. You can disable analytics in
      the extension at any time; after you disable it, the extension stops
      sending analytics events.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, rent, trade, or share your saved ChatGPT sessions or
      conversation content. If you enable analytics, limited product events are
      sent to getmanov.com and may be processed using Netlify and Google
      Analytics 4 as described above.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any updates will be
      published on this page with a revised effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact:
      <a href="mailto:ivangetmanov@icloud.com">ivangetmanov@icloud.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .policy-page {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 0 48px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #0d6b5f;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .effective-date {
      color: #687384;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
